config VIRTIO_EXTENT
	tristate "Virtio extent-store device"
	depends on VIRTIO
	help
	  The driver of fxdax's virtio extent-store device, which a guest's Fxfs
	  stores its filesystem through: extents it names, written once and freed
	  whole, a root, and a DAX window that extents map into.
